Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:05.55,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻 愛愛愛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:09.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 有點焦了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.96,0:00:12.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在想昨天的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:23.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然人沒出什麼事 但我們卻沒能保護好公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:27.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下強到可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:32.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 一想到以後 心裡就沒個底
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:37.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！好了 再多想也沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:43.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在能夠辦到的 就是變得更強 好保護小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.35,0:00:46.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們神采飛揚地向前看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:47.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:52.46,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Maje Maje Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:58.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 Cure Majesty究竟是什麼來頭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:01:00.02,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,非常厲害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:03.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨應該會了解一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.63,0:01:05.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,但她現在去藍天大地了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.63,0:01:05.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1080,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:06.34,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:08.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.31,0:01:10.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,她說她知道Cure Majesty是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.19,0:01:13.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！告訴我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:15.15,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,就是小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:16.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:19.39,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空就是Cure Majesty啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}大變身！Cure Majesty!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50\pos(1085,970)}威愛愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:00.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:02.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是Cure Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:03.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,變身！可厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:08.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可是Cure Majesty要來的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:11.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,年齡比小空要大得多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:14.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這可說不定 她可是命運之子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:16.18,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:21.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想起來了 卡疤痛也說過 他們是盯上了小空的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:26.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要是指的就是變身為最強的Precure的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:31.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主是Cure Majesty 也就順理成章了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:35.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 現在能夠變身成Cure Majesty嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.05,0:03:36.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:42.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:50.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:54.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:03:58.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:03.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,用湯匙變身...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:06.28,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.17,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:12.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 變身！厲害的！沒有騙人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.99,0:04:14.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:19.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:21.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:23.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:28.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,現在只是還不清楚 是什麼原因影響了變身
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:31.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哭哭 哭哭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:32.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:34.15,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:35.28,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.45,0:04:39.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就讓我這個 目標是成為最強保育員的出馬吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:43.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一起思考怎麼樣才能夠順利變身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:44.97,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:47.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙也要為了變得更強而努力！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:49.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.38,0:04:52.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道什麼時候一人之下會再次發動攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:54.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也要加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:56.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主也要奮鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:04:58.21,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:06.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:11.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那位Cure Majesty終究是降臨了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:12.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:18.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要在她掌握那股強大的力量之前 抹除掉隱患
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:20.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:25.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,事情就全部交給我來辦吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:32.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！呀！耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:33.60,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:36.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小蝶姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:38.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,變身進展地怎麼樣了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:40.26,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:42.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是有在努力啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:46.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嘗試了多種變身姿勢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:50.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,然後就決定來參考一下前輩Precure的小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:54.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,前... 輩...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:57.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,力拔山兮氣蓋世！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:00.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:03.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,晴天天天... 啊噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:05.03,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:10.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 噠噠噠噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:13.76,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:15.73,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.23,0:06:17.35,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 來！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:20.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 可是對小空來說 還...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.39,0:06:22.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,讓她試試吧 來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:29.37,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:30.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:35.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:38.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,空... 空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:40.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,當心！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:42.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:44.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,接得漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:48.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是覺得鍛鍊過 就能夠成功變身吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.32,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:52.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,挑戰無止境！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:55.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,接著去小白那裡看看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:56.54,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:00.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:03.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！我正在做優格
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:08.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,為了變得更強 我加入了富含維他命的檸檬汁！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠活力大增啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:13.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶 你嚐嚐看！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好清香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:18.03,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:23.87,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,活力充沛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:27.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.56,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:31.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空喝這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:32.80,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,這個好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那個是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:36.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:42.16,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,還... 還是太酸了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:48.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 這種時候...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝一口這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:51.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,對對對！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:58.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.05,0:08:04.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是覺得補充活力後 就能夠變身了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:05.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:08.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 你努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:11.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,接著去少年那裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:13.55,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:19.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥的時候 保持陣型平衡非常關鍵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.05,0:08:23.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,只要應用這個航空力學的公式 就能加以改良...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.13,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,幻鏡筆！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:28.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.31,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:35.43,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！那個 借我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:38.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你要這支幻鏡筆嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:40.34,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年 給她試試吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:43.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 好的 給
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:48.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:51.63,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:55.89,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:59.84,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,變身！變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:02.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哈... 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:03.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:08.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那支筆是我專用的 所以你想要變身...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:11.78,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚... 嗚... 嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:14.61,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:15.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:16.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:20.23,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚... 嗚... 嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.39,0:09:21.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不哭不哭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:26.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 已經非常努力了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:31.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,可是進展不太順利 心裡很難過吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.32,0:09:33.76,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:39.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空應該也有只屬於小空的幻鏡筆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:43.62,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,只屬於 小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:47.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那要靠小空自己去尋找
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:53.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空肯定能夠找到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:55.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:57.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼噼噼 噼噼噼...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:01.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？這麼焦急
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼噼噼！噼噼噼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.11,0:10:05.79,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.22,0:10:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:08.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:13.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:19.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:33.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,破壞 破壞！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:36.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,破壞更多...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:38.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:41.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥兒們說的就是他！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:45.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,彌諾彤？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:47.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那副樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:51.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來了啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:57.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我使用暗塌谷能量 讓那傢伙重獲新生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:03.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,他已經是為實現我等目的 而效勞的忠誠奴僕了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:08.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 打倒...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:15.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對颯拉拉隊長使用過的手段！不可饒恕！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不會把公主交給你們的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:23.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我等已不再執著得到公主了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:25.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不再...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,執著？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:32.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,在此將爾等一網打盡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:33.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:35.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:36.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,如你所願！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:38.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主快去安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.31,0:11:40.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
