Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:10.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:13.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到你了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:18.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,從你開始一個個收拾...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:20.76,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:24.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:29.72,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 變身... 可厲害了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.43,0:14:36.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,否！否 否 否！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:39.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,否！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,接招吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:44.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這... 這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.05,0:14:48.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,接下已是最強的 吾的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:53.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:55.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.03,0:14:58.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,沒用的 沒用 沒用！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:00.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:05.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是無法保護公主的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:08.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:10.31,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:16.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:20.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:27.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,無畏的掙扎！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:34.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:35.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:37.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:40.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對會！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,保護好！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:45.11,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,保...護...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:48.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.71,0:15:58.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈... 哈... 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:01.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然能堅持到這個程度...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:03.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,雖為敵人 還是得夸...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:08.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,否 否！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:10.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只想收拾掉你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:14.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的力量已經所剩無幾！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.08,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:19.46,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴... 真白...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:23.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼... 蝴蝶...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:29.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚... 不要！不要 不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:34.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這一下 就結束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:36.98,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:39.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:41.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:45.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,保護好！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:48.84,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 家人！最喜歡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:50.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也要...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.68,0:16:53.15,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,保護你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:58.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空應該也有只屬於小空的幻鏡筆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:04.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那要靠小空自己去尋找
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.22,0:17:08.07,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.69,0:17:10.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也能變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:12.04,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:18.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:18.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:22.04,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:22.04,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:28.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:30.91,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,威嚴仁愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:30.91,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
