Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.60,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.60,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.78,0:17:56.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.78,0:17:56.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
