Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,崇高降世的神秘！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:21.76,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,威愛愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:21.76,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Cure Majesty！
