Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:39.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:40.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:43.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.41,0:18:44.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:47.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,只屬於小空的環境筆！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:52.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那支筆 是由每個人心中的感情所化作的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.55,0:18:55.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly 你從一開始就明白的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:19:00.97,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你... 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,看我絕地反擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:09.03,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:12.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:18.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:28.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,雕蟲小技！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:32.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:44.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.94,0:19:49.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾是... 最強！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:52.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.73,0:20:03.42,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:06.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的強
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:09.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是公主的...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:13.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:17.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:26.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
