Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:05.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你還需要繼續戰鬥...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.41,0:21:18.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.41,0:21:18.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:26.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是累了 睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.82,0:21:33.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主睡得好熟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:38.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼小的身體裡 有著那麼大的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.72,0:21:41.02,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙是怎麼想的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:46.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,心底還是沒個底吧 但是以後能在我們的身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:49.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一起戰鬥 還有點得意的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.48,0:21:50.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.47,0:21:51.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:53.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為了保護最強的小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.30,0:21:58.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也只能變得更加強大！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:21:59.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.64,0:22:00.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,加油吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.99,0:22:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（三人嬉笑）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:03.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
