Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:09.18,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1075,970)}威愛愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:13.08,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 要和我一起跳哦！
